WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.178 --> 00:00:03.600
To receive the incoming
calls from bettors,

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.090 position:63%
the bookmaker relies on several devices,

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:10.200
which may keep his location,
or private phone, secret.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.577
Remember when gambling on sports

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.430
was illegal in America?

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.330
Gambling was something

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.550 position:59%
that was in the shadows around sports,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.310
and it was considered unseemly.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.840
The primary interest I have

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.190
is in the integrity of the game,

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:27.303
so that's why we've opposed
sports gambling in the past.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.219
Today, the idea of sports gambling

00:00:30.219 --> 00:00:33.390 position:61%
once being illegal almost seems quaint.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.070
The NFL is finally here,

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.630
and I know you're ready to gamble.

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.500
This is probably gonna be one

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.479 position:66%
of the most heavily bet props in the game.

00:00:39.479 --> 00:00:42.314
What are some strategies
for teasers, in your eyes?

00:00:42.314 --> 00:00:43.283
Play 'em. Just play 'em.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.110
Once allowed only in Nevada,

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:49.560
betting on sports is now
legal in more than 31 states,

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.540
with more on the docket.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:52.373
To say the floodgates have
opened is putting it mildly.

00:00:52.373 --> 00:00:53.206
This is the largest and
fastest growth of gambling

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.040
in our nation's history.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.570
Legal sports betting in the US

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:04.290
went from less than $5
billion in bets placed in 2018

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.761
to 57 billion in 2021,

00:01:06.761 --> 00:01:11.700
and an estimate of 200
billion overall in 2023.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.960
[Jamie] Showtime.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.490
A-list celebrities,

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:16.440
billion-dollar marketing budgets,

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.889
partnerships with every
major sports league,

00:01:18.889 --> 00:01:22.503
today, sports betting
is impossible to avoid,

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.310 position:58%
and the top sports gambling companies

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:29.910
work more like Facebook and
Google than a Las Vegas casino,

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:33.150
using big data to encourage
more bets from users,

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.660
while simultaneously
keeping down big winners.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.860 position:59%
What we see with online sports betting

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.636
and mobile sports apps

00:01:40.636 --> 00:01:43.462 position:56%
looks a lot more like a slot machine

00:01:43.462 --> 00:01:46.200
than traditional sports betting.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.720 position:59%
We know that there will be some people

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:52.710
for whom this expansion will
cause devastating problems.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.160 position:64%
Sports gambling is a progressive illness.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.680
When you're a compulsive gambler

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.160
and they're giving you all
these extra propositions,

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.080 position:64%
and they're giving you this live betting,

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.012
you have no chance whatsoever.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.190
Unfortunately, the history
of legalized gambling

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:12.023
in America

00:02:12.023 --> 00:02:14.010 position:61%
is replete with failures of government,

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:15.014
and failures of operators

00:02:15.014 --> 00:02:17.355 position:59%
to really seriously consider balancing

00:02:17.355 --> 00:02:20.580 position:64%
the social costs with the economic gains.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:21.510
So while sports

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.360
is a multi-billion-dollar industry,

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:27.423
it's possible the costs
may outweigh the gains.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:42.150
Today, FanDuel and DraftKings
are the undisputed giants

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:43.500
of sports betting.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.500
Just turn on your TV
during any sporting event.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.480
But they didn't start out that way.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.693
They started as daily
fantasy companies, or DFCs.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:55.110
Daily fantasy sports
plays by its own rule set.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.413
You have to create your own lineup.

00:02:56.413 --> 00:02:57.742
There's a salary cap.

00:02:57.742 --> 00:02:59.760
You enter into these tournaments,

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.110
you pay your entry fee,

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.581
and then you win a prize
depending on how you perform

00:03:03.581 --> 00:03:06.090
under the rules of that contest.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.506
There were a few others doing it.

00:03:07.506 --> 00:03:08.910
FanDuel, DraftStreet,

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.200
so it was really just, you know,

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.720
daily fantasy sports
that we were pitching.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.550
The question at the time,

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.440
was it considered gambling?

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.170
Fantasy sports was in
something of a gray area.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.350
It was viewed by some states
as a form of gambling,

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:25.320
and before that Supreme Court
ruling that wasn't allowed.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.030
You couldn't gamble on sports.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.920
We didn't really understand
the political angle

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.030
that potentially ensue.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:32.250
We just thought fantasy
sports is a skill game,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.120
that's kinda settled,

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.967
and we went about
building it in such a way.

00:03:35.967 --> 00:03:39.650
I won over 2 million bucks
thanks to DraftKings.com.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:42.180
In 2015 daily fantasy sports,

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.250
there was quite a bit of
investment into FanDuel

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.470
and into our primary competitor,

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:49.560
and that money fueled a
land grab for customers,

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.780 position:58%
